sentences.text:
While imposing conditions learned court in seisin over the matter shall impose the following additional conditions :
i) shall cooperate with the investigation and appear before the I.O. as and when required for the purpose of investigation;
ii) shall indulge in similar nature of offence while on bail;
iii) shall appear before the trial court on each and every date fixed without fail.

